Growing interest and movement in reconnecting with cultural roots and spiritual practices continues to rise within the Asian diaspora communities, I had the pleasure of chatting with Tina Wang (@tina_wangxt) from @joysauceofficial.

From a young age, I was drawn to spirituality and the occult—curiosities that weren’t always accepted or embraced by my family or  community, even going back 8-9 years ago when I first started my journey.  Now, we're witnessing a beautiful and powerful shift as the diaspora navigates the intricate process of weaving cultural spiritual practices with their evolving Asian diaspora identity.

